    "description": "Ordered hierarchical taxonomy for the 2,646 UMLS CUIs in the ImageCLEFmedical 2026 / ROCOv2 concept-detection dataset. The order of `categories` (and of `subcategories` within each) is significant: it encodes a topological, general-to-specific flow intended for building a directed acyclic graph. The flow mirrors radiological interpretation: how the image was acquired (Modality) -> what was imaged (Anatomy) -> what is observed (Radiological Finding) -> what it means (Pathology) -> what artificial objects/actions are present (Device & Intervention) -> abstract clinical context.",
    "dag_ordering": "Edges should flow from earlier categories toward later ones. Category 1 (Modality) is the root layer; Category 6 (Clinical Context) is the most downstream/abstract layer.",
    "n_concepts": 2646
